  "id": "speech-recognition-system",
  "term": "speech recognition system",
  "definition": "A speech recognition system is technology that converts spoken language from audio recordings into text so the speech can be transcribed and further analyzed. In this context, it is an automatic system trained for children's speech and used to speed the processing of oral narrative data, sometimes with human checking to improve accuracy.",
